# A100/A102 kernel desktop (sd-base, no #Z). The C:\ window is open at boot.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the injector.
# A: idle. Select BIG.NCP in the window (single click), park -> B.
# Pointer to (400,8) = bar row right of "Options" -> C. CR (0x1C/0x9C)
# while resting there -> D: after = the selection is cleared at once
# (THEACTIVE = titles' sum, the row right of Options is the desktop's);
# before = still selected (THEACTIVE screen-wide: the desktop sits in the
# track until the pointer leaves the row) -> cleared only at E after parkbr.
# File title (88,8) -> F: the box down (after: outside border, x 67 / y 18
# .. x 226 / y 304; before: inside, x 68 / y 19 .. x 225 / y 303 and the
# titles 16 px further left). Hover "Close top window" (entry 6) -> G.
# Out to the desktop, click = cancel, park -> H.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 95 140
1900 down
1903 up
2400 parkbr
2900 mark B_ICON_SELECTED
3200 move 400 8
3700 mark C_REST_RIGHT_OF_OPTIONS
4000 key 1C
4003 key 9C
4600 mark D_CR_WHILE_RESTING
4900 parkbr
5400 mark E_PARKED
5700 move 88 8
6200 mark F_FILE_OPEN
6500 move 88 142
7000 mark G_FILE_ENTRY_HOVER
7300 move 400 300
7600 down
7603 up
8100 parkbr
8600 mark H_CLOSED
